# History search/navigation details found by the differential fuzzer.
tags: history search fuzz

=== noninc-minibuffer-keeps-mark
tags: non-incremental-reverse-search-history
description: the mark is not reset while the search string is read
screen: 40x8
--- script
readline "a much longer prompt string> "
--- keys
2\M-0\C-k\M-p<dump>\C-g\r

=== end-of-history-at-end-keeps-undo
tags: end-of-history undo
--- script
readline "> " 2
--- keys
wy\M-><dump>\C-_<dump>\r!r\M->\C-_<dump>\r

=== isearch-from-edited-entry-commits-edits
tags: reverse-search-history undo
--- script
add_history "a.b"
add_history "zz"
readline "> " 2 addhist
history_dump
--- keys
\C-p\C-pofk\C-rzz<dumpfull>\C-g<dumpfull>\C-n\C-p<dumpfull>\r\C-p\C-p\C-p<dumpfull>\r

=== isearch-from-edited-entry-accept
tags: reverse-search-history undo
--- script
add_history "a.b"
add_history "zz"
readline "> " 2 addhist
history_dump
--- keys
\C-p\C-pofk\C-rzz\C-j<dumpfull>\C-p<dumpfull>\r\r
